# Sandbox design presentation

[PowerPoint: AI4Research Sandbox Design rev4](output/AI4Research%20Sandbox%20Design%20rev4.pptx). [Live editable deck](page://page_7a233186a3548191869c85106fc552b4).

Ten main slides explain the complete system; seven hidden appendix slides support questions. The goal and intended AI4R value come first. The near-front Karpathy quotation motivates retained project state while explicitly distinguishing it from continual learning in model weights. The workload example is removed. VM per lab remains selected, using the comparison's visual style. Research is cyclical, with local retries and overlapping independent work.

The large diagrams are embedded as editable PowerPoint objects. The upstream Figure 2 is an attributed original image. All slides include source/limit notes. The diagrams below are previews of the same slide content, not replacements for the editable diagrams in the PPTX.

